        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Chimpanzé. Chimchar é muito ágil. Ele apaga a chama da cauda antes de dormir. Um gás produzido em sua barriga alimenta o fogo em seu traseiro, e a chama fica mais fraca quando ele está doente.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Chimchar pode evoluir para Monferno no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Ember, Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Flame Wheel</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Facade, Fire Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Slack Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Flamethrower</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Attract, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Burning Jealousy, Confide, Covet, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fire Blast, Fire Pledge, Fire Punch, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Fling, Focus Energy, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gunk Shot, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Metronome, Mud-Slap, Nasty Plot, Overheat, Poison Jab, Protect, Psych Up, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Torment, Toxic, U-turn, Uproar, Vacuum Wave, Will-O-Wisp, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Assist, Blaze Kick, Counter, Double Kick, Encore, Fake Out, Fire Punch, Focus Energy, Focus Punch, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Power- Up Punch, Quick Guard, Submission, Switcheroo, Thunder Punch</p>",
